  X1["<b>Change this here</b><br/>amber = we edit · teal = source sends"]:::hdr
  X2["<b>What moves downstream</b><br/>then the common tail:<br/>Ontology → change feed → monitoring"]:::hdr
  X3["<b>Evaluation id moves?</b><br/>amber = yes · green = no<br/>hashed: signal key · a · PRR · label_check<br/>window · labels searched · labels read by AI"]:::hdr
  X4["<b>What the officer sees</b><br/>Workshop pages and cards"]:::app
  X5["<b>Existing triage decisions</b><br/>unchanged · linked by subject_key, not the id<br/>no stale flag: known gap, PLANNED"]:::gap
  X1 ~~~ X2 ~~~ X3 ~~~ X4 ~~~ X5

  E1["<b>1 · Synonym row</b><br/>label_synonyms.py + bump SYN_VERSION"]:::edit
  M1["label status flips → signals in / out<br/>build-dated snapshot_diff events"]:::pipeline
  V1["<b>Yes, every signal</b>, but only if<br/>SYN_VERSION is bumped (always bump)"]:::moves
  S1["Card 1 + page 1 queue shrink<br/>page 3: signal events (build day)"]:::app
  T1["Stays linked · now on an older id<br/>no stale flag"]:::keep
  E1 --> M1 --> V1 --> S1 --> T1

  E2["<b>2 · Bucket keyword</b><br/>BUCKETS in ontology_signals.py"]:::edit
  M2["bucket, is_ranked, rank → ranked queue<br/>build-dated snapshot_diff events"]:::pipeline
  V2["<b>No</b>: bucket is not hashed"]:::same
  S2["Page 1 queue · card 1"]:::app
  T2["Stays linked · id still current"]:::keep
  E2 --> M2 --> V2 --> S2 --> T2

  E3["<b>3 · New FAERS quarter</b><br/>QUARTERS + WINDOW (hand-set)"]:::edit
  M3["deletes, a/b/c/d, PRR, every AE Stat key<br/>signals new / gone · freshness, drift"]:::pipeline
  V3["<b>Yes</b> (a, PRR, window)"]:::moves
  S3["Page 1 counts + ranks · card 1<br/>FAERS as-of row"]:::app
  T3["Stays linked · now on an older id<br/>no stale flag"]:::keep
  E3 --> M3 --> V3 --> S3 --> T3

  E4["<b>4 · Add a drug</b><br/>INGREDIENTS (4 raw files) + FORMULARY"]:::edit
  M4["new RxCUI everywhere → its signals<br/>incremental FAERS replays all quarters"]:::pipeline
  V4["<b>New ids</b> for its signals<br/>others only if their PRR moves"]:::moves
  S4["New drug in every filter<br/>cards 1 and 2 grow"]:::app
  T4["Stays linked · older id only<br/>where PRR moved · no stale flag"]:::keep
  E4 --> M4 --> V4 --> S4 --> T4

  E5["<b>5 · New label version</b><br/>DailyMed publishes it"]:::source
  M5["1 new XML · label re-checked · pilot label:<br/>all its sections re-sent to the model<br/>one build-dated snapshot_diff event"]:::pipeline
  V5["<b>Only if</b> labels searched or read by AI<br/>change: version and text not hashed"]:::moves
  S5["Page 3: 'spl version n → n+1'<br/>(build day) · maybe a signal gone"]:::app
  T5["Stays linked · looks current even<br/>if the label changed · no stale flag"]:::keep
  E5 --> M5 --> V5 --> S5 --> T5

  E6["<b>6 · Recall status</b><br/>openFDA: Ongoing → Terminated"]:::source
  M6["is_active → active count<br/>one build-dated status event"]:::pipeline
  V6["n/a: recalls carry no id"]:::same
  S6["Card 2 drops · page 2 · page 3 event"]:::app
  T6["Stays linked · untouched"]:::keep
  E6 --> M6 --> V6 --> S6 --> T6

  E7["<b>7 · Officer submits a decision</b><br/>Action (demo default: Cancel)"]:::edit
  M7["new MSSM Triage Decision object<br/>(Ontology edit) · no build"]:::pipeline
  V7["Stores the current id"]:::same
  S7["Row in page 1 decisions table<br/>link in Object Explorer"]:::app
  T7["Older ones stay linked, untouched<br/>(create-only, no delete)"]:::keep
  E7 --> M7 --> V7 --> S7 --> T7

  E8["<b>8 · Prompt or model version</b><br/>PROMPT_VERSION, MODEL_ID, PARSER_VERSION"]:::edit
  M8["new cache key → 9 pilot sections re-sent<br/>cache hit rate 0 that build · re-score gold"]:::pipeline
  V8["<b>No</b>: prompt not in the id<br/>(label_check stays ai_v1)"]:::same
  S8["Usually nothing"]:::app
  T8["Stays linked · cannot tell<br/>which prompt it saw"]:::keep
  E8 --> M8 --> V8 --> S8 --> T8

  E9["<b>9 · Workshop variable</b><br/>e.g. Changes last 30 days"]:::edit
  M9["that card / table only · no build<br/>(save + publish the module)"]:::pipeline
  V9["n/a"]:::same
  S9["Card 3 number"]:::app
  T9["Stays linked · untouched"]:::keep
  E9 --> M9 --> V9 --> S9 --> T9
